# Web Development Project

## 📌 About the Project

This project is a frontend web application developed using HTML and CSS

It contains multiple web pages connected together to provide a complete website interface.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

## 📂 Project Structure

- `index.html` – Main/home page
- `home.html` – Home page
- `login.html` – Login page
- `index1.html` – Additional webpage
- `catalogue.html` – Catalogue page

## ✨ Features

- User-friendly interface
- Multiple interconnected webpages
- Responsive web design
- Navigation between different pages
- Clean and simple frontend design

## 🚀 How to Run

1. Download or clone this project.
2. Open `index.html` in a web browser.
3. Navigate through the different pages using the provided links.

